```
npm install
mkdir -p ~/Library/LaunchAgents
mv ./com.austenmc.bunnylol-ritp.plist ./com.austenmc.bunnylol-thebehavioral.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.austenmc.bunnylol-ritp.plist
launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.austenmc.bunnylol-thebehavioral.plist
```

ritp:          http://localhost:8998/bunnylol?mode=ritp&search=%s
thebehavioral: http://localhost:8999/bunnylol?mode=thebehavioral&search=%s
